      "solution": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 1.38;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Logic:</span> a @ b = a<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> + b</span></p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 1.38;\">5 @ 2 = ? <span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">→ 5</span><span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> + 2 = 25 + 2 = 27</span></p>\n\n<div>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 1.38;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">So, 27 will come in the place of '?'.</span></p>\n</div>\n",
