      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">The pattern observed is: (First Number)<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>&nbsp;= Second Number.</p>\n\n<p><strong>For 4 : 16 &rarr;</strong></p>\n\n<p>4<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 16</p>\n\n<p><strong>Similarly, let&#39;s find the missing number for 5 : ?</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>5<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 25</strong></p>\n\n<p>Therefore, the missing number is 25.</p>\n\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">Hence, the correct answer is &ldquo;<b>Option 2</b>&rdquo;.</p>\n",
