      "question": "Read the following statement carefully and identify the conclusion that follows. Statement: No apple is blue. All oranges are apples. Conclusions: I. No orange is blue. II. Some apples are oranges.",
      "questionHtml": "Read the following statement carefully and identify the conclusion that follows.<br />\nStatement:<br />\nNo apple is blue. All oranges are apples.<br />\nConclusions:<br />\nI. No orange is blue.<br />\nII. Some apples are oranges.",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Only I follows",
          "html": "Only I follows"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Only II follows",
          "html": "Only II follows"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Both I and II follow",
          "html": "Both I and II follow"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Neither I nor II follows",
          "html": "Neither I nor II follows"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/26/03/IMG-2132_Yogesh%285%29.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 94px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Conclusions:</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">I. No orange is blue. → <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Follow </span>(As no apple is blue and all oranges are apples. So whole oranges comes in apple which cannot be blue, therefore it is true.)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">II. Some apples are oranges → <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Follow</span> (A all oranges are apples. So whole oranges comes in apple, therefore it is true.)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Thus, both I and II follow.</p>\n",
