      "id": "fd3aaf105dfd-q19",
      "number": 19,
      "question": "What will come in the place of '?' in the following equation, if '+' and 'x' are interchanged and '-' and '&divide;' are interchanged? 15 &divide; 36 - 18 + 0 &times; 25 = ?",
      "questionHtml": "What will come in the place of &#39;?&#39; in the following equation, if &#39;+&#39; and &#39;x&#39; are interchanged and &#39;-&#39; and &#39;&divide;&#39; are interchanged?<br />\n15 &divide; 36 - 18 + 0 &times; 25 = ?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "36",
          "html": "36"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "40",
          "html": "40"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "46",
          "html": "46"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "50",
          "html": "50"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">BODMAS Table:&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage14137.png\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Given equation:&nbsp;15 &divide; 36 - 18 + 0 &times; 25 = ?</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:150px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Original Symbol</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>New Symbol</strong></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>+</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>&times;</strong></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>&times;</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>+</strong></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>-</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>&divide;</strong></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>&divide;</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>-</strong></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><br />\nNow, replacing the symbols:</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;15 - 36 &divide; 18 &times; 0 + 25 = ?</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;15 - <u><strong>36 &divide; 18</strong></u> &times; 0 + 25 = ?</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;15 - <u><strong>2 &times; 0</strong></u> + 25 = ?</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;15 - <u><strong>0</strong></u> + 25 = ?</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;<u><strong>15 - 0</strong></u> + 25 = ?</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;<u><strong>15 + 25</strong></u> = ?</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;<u><strong>40</strong></u>.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Hence, the correct answer is&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&quot;Option 2&quot;</span>.</p>\n",
      "images": [
        "//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage14137.png"
      ],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
