      "number": 20,
      "question": "If A * B = A + B + AB, then what is 3 * 2?",
      "questionHtml": "If A * B = A + B + AB, then what is 3 * 2?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "11",
          "html": "11"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "12",
          "html": "12"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "10",
          "html": "10"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "13",
          "html": "13"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage6a0bfebb7bc72ae09afcb59e.png\" /><br />\n<span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\">The mathematical operation is defined as: <strong>A * B = A + B + AB</strong></span>\n\n<p><br />\nWe need to evaluate the expression for <strong>3 * 2</strong>.</p>\n\n<p>&rArr;&nbsp;<strong>A = 3</strong> and <strong>B = 2</strong>.</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 3 * 2 = 3 + 2 + (<u><strong>3 &times; 2</strong></u>)</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 3 * 2 = 3 + 2 + 6</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 3 * 2 = 5 + 6</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 3 * 2 = 11</p>\n\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \">Hence, the correct answer is &ldquo;<b>Option 1</b>&rdquo;.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
      "images": [
        "//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage6a0bfebb7bc72ae09afcb59e.png"
      ],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
