    {
      "id": "fd3aaf105dfd-q25",
      "number": 25,
      "question": "You see smoke coming from your neighbor's house. What would you do?",
      "questionHtml": "You see smoke coming from your neighbor&#39;s house. What would you do?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Ignore it",
          "html": "Ignore it"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Call the fire department immediately",
          "html": "Call the fire department immediately"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Wait and see if the smoke increases",
          "html": "Wait and see if the smoke increases"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Knock on the door to check",
          "html": "Knock on the door to check"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">According to the given situation:</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 500px;\">\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Option</th>\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Statement</th>\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Correctness</th>\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Reasoning</th>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">1</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Ignore it</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Incorrect</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Ignoring smoke from a house can put lives and property in danger. It reflects irresponsibility and lack of concern for safety.</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">2</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Call the fire department immediately</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Correct</span></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">This is the most responsible and immediate action in an emergency situation. Promptly informing the fire department can help prevent loss of life and property.</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">3</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Wait and see if the smoke increases</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Incorrect</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Delaying action during a possible fire emergency may worsen the situation and reduce the chances of timely rescue and control.</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">4</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Knock on the door to check</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); text-align: center;\">Incorrect</span></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Checking on the neighbor shows concern, but directly calling emergency services is a safer and quicker response in such a critical situation.</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Qualities Projected in this situation: </span><span>Alertness, responsibility, quick decision-making, and concern for public safety.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Hence, <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">&quot;Option 2&quot;</span> is the correct answer.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/key-point-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /> <strong> <span style=\"vertical-align: middle; font-size: 21px;\"><u>Key Points</u></span> </strong> </span> <span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Checklist for attempting SRT questions:</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">1) Read the situation and options carefully.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">2) Choose the option that reflects responsibility, courage, and practical thinking.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">3) Avoid options showing negligence, fear, or unnecessary delay.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">4) Select actions that ensure safety and demonstrate presence of mind.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">5) Be logical, alert, and quick in responding to emergency situations.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /> <strong> <span style=\"vertical-align: middle; font-size: 21px;\"><u>Additional Information</u></span> </strong> </span> <span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Officer qualities:</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/12/OLQ.PNG\" style=\"width: 481px; height: 458px;\" /></p>\n",
      "images": [
        "//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/key-point-image.png",
        "//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png",
